@host = https://localhost:7024
@token = PASTE_LOCAL_DEVELOPMENT_TOKEN
@policyId = PASTE_POLICY_ID
@etag = PASTE_QUOTED_ETAG

### Process liveness - anonymous
GET {{host}}/health

###

### List organization policies
GET {{host}}/api/v1/policies?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get policy and copy its ETag response header
GET {{host}}/api/v1/policies/{{policyId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Create Draft policy - synthetic data only
POST {{host}}/api/v1/policies
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "policyNumber": "SYNTH-2026-0001",
  "insuredAmount": 125000.00,
  "currency": "EUR"
}

###

### Activate Draft policy - copy the latest quoted ETag into @etag
POST {{host}}/api/v1/policies/{{policyId}}/activate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-Match: {{etag}}

{
  "insuredPartyReference": "SYNTH-INSURED-0001",
  "coverageStartDate": "2026-09-01",
  "coverageEndDate": "2027-08-31"
}

###

### Cancel Draft or Active policy - use the newest ETag
POST {{host}}/api/v1/policies/{{policyId}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-Match: {{etag}}

{
  "reason": "Synthetic customer request"
}

###

### View append-only transition history
GET {{host}}/api/v1/policies/{{policyId}}/transitions
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Authentication example - expected 401 Unauthorized
GET {{host}}/api/v1/policies
Accept: application/json

###

### Validation example - expected 400 Bad Request
POST {{host}}/api/v1/policies
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "policyNumber": "SYNTH-2026-INVALID",
  "insuredAmount": 0,
  "currency": "EUR"
}
